    "quote": "Suppose the observation noise is i.i.d., zero-mean and a Gaussian of variance $\\sigma^2>0$, and the input domain $\\mathcal{X} \\subset \\mathbb{S}^{d-1}$. Then the maximum information gain associated with the NTK of a fully-connected ReLU network is bounded by $\\gamma_T = \\mathcal{O}(...)$"
   },
